This has also been my experience.  I've cleaned out shops
without any attempt at training, with tripe training, by
carrying tripe, by keeping one tripe and training with the
rest.  In my experience the effect of carrying one vastly
overwhelms any effect at training.  On the other hand
carrying one means the pet doesn't go to the far corner
of the shop unless there's tripe over there.

> Prepare a shop,

Does this mean shuttling items you want close to the door
and ones you don't farther from the door?  That seems to
help with or without training.

> drop your starting capital inside,

Two or three away from the door?  For me pets seem to
ignore gold inside shops since I've started trying this but that
might be the RNG at work.

> stand in the door

This seems to be my problem.  If I stand in the square that has
the door I can't tell when my pet picks stuff up a lot of the time
so I stand in the drop square one in.  Then I retreat to the door
as the pet approaches.

